flowchart TD
    Start([Start: TICRequestDocument]) --> Input[/Input: tic_id, query_id, doc_note/]
    Input --> QUsers[(Query USERS & ROLE Tables)]
    QUsers --> CheckRole{Role == TIC?}
    
    CheckRole -- No --> Err1[/Return Error: Unauthorized/]
    CheckRole -- Yes --> QQuery[(Query D3: QUERIES)]
    
    QQuery --> CheckOwner{Query found & assigned to TIC?}
    CheckOwner -- No --> Err2[/Return Error: Invalid/Unauthorized query/]
    
    CheckOwner -- Yes --> CheckNote{doc_note empty?}
    CheckNote -- Yes --> Err3[/Return Error: Cannot be empty/]
    
    CheckNote -- No --> UpdateFields[Update status = Documents Required & note]
    UpdateFields --> UpdateDB[(Update D3: QUERIES)]
    UpdateDB --> InitAudit[Initialize audit_record]
    InitAudit --> InsertAudit[(Insert into D7: AUDIT_LOGS)]
    InsertAudit --> Notif[Call DispatchNotificationAsync: Student]
    
    Notif --> Output[/Return Success/]
    Output --> End([End])
    
    Err1 --> End
    Err2 --> End
    Err3 --> End